WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.003
Joy to the world

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:06.673
The Lord is come

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:12.012
Let earth receive her King.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.685
It's not because
the gays know theatre,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:24.316
it's because the gays just
know how to do stuff.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.692
You know?

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:27.736
I mean, they're survivors.

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:33.617
And for some reason they're
always obsessed with me.

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:38.497
I don't know why.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.333
But I like it.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:46.129
These gorgeous stars came
with the tree. I love them.

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.798
I do too.

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:50.551
Give.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.265
He's going on a date.

00:00:58.016 --> 00:00:59.768
-Like from Grindr?
-No.

00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:00.644
Oh my god.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.730
Jesus H Christ.

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:06.316
I know. I know.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.027
No, that's the title
of my play.

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.904
Oh.

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:13.115
All the world's a stage

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:17.911
And most of us are
desperately under-rehearsed.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.831
Who said that?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.709
-Wasn't Shakespeare.
-Who?

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.671
I can't remember,
that's why I asked.

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:30.716
It could've been
Captain Kangaroo.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:31.884
He was smart.

00:01:36.597 --> 00:01:37.681
Try that.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.517
No one's listening. Listen!

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.769
Listen!

00:01:42.853 --> 00:01:45.063
But I just thought
everyone should know

00:01:45.981 --> 00:01:50.694
that the pageant is a giant
load of crap on a stick.

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:54.406
And not in a good way
if you know what I mean.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:56.575
Unless you look deeper,

00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:00.454
there was nothing
particularly remarkable

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:03.665
about Mary.

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:06.376
Mary rode a donkey.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:14.218
Mary liked camels
and donkeys.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.473
And rode them both.

00:02:20.057 --> 00:02:23.977
Nancy Michaelson, she just
came up to me and she said,

00:02:24.061 --> 00:02:27.731
"Your show was so damn good
it needs to go on tour."

00:02:28.774 --> 00:02:31.443
Congratulations, it really
was a great show, Sand.

00:02:31.527 --> 00:02:33.612
You agree
that it should go on tour?

00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:34.530
What?

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:36.782
-I don't know what to--
-Oh my god.

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:37.824
And you know what?

00:02:37.908 --> 00:02:39.284
I think it should be
a national tour.

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:43.372
And this time, Ellen Greene
can be my understudy.

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:47.084
Be right back. Or not.

00:02:47.793 --> 00:02:50.671
For I've been making eyes
with a very handsome man

00:02:50.754 --> 00:02:53.340
and now it's time
to land the plane.

